---
layout: base.njk
title: About
permalink: /about/
description: Meet the Connecticut Women's USA Gymnastics state committee, officers, and meeting minutes. Learn about our mission.
---

{# Hero Banner #}
<section class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-14">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[color:var(--usag-red)]">Official State Governance</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">About Connecticut Women&rsquo;s USA Gymnastics</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">Supporting Connecticut athletes, coaches, judges, clubs, and sanctioned events through clear state procedures, committee leadership, education, and athlete safety resources.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-slate-200 py-5 text-sm sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-950">State Committee Term</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-slate-600">7/1/2025 &ndash; 6/30/2027</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-950">Committee Scope</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Competition procedures, state meets, clinics, and member communication</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-950">Resources</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-slate-600">Meeting minutes, policy highlights, and qualification standards</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
  <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_20rem]">
    {# Main column #}
    <div class="space-y-10">

      {# Intro text #}
      <div class="max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
        <p>The Connecticut State Administrative Committee determines state competition procedures within the framework of USA Gymnastics National and Regional Rules &amp; Policies. The committee meets each June to set policies and schedules for the following year and is polled throughout the year on regional judging assignments, state meet panels, and other issues as they arise.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Committee members with public email addresses have a contact link next to their name. For general inquiries, contact State Chairman Kim Vaillancourt. If you have questions or concerns, please put them in writing as their job is to represent the membership.</p>
      </div>

      {# Committee Members #}
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">State Committee</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">

          {% set members = state_committee %}

          {% for member in members %}
          <details class="group border-slate-200 {% if not loop.first %}border-t{% endif %}">
            <summary class="grid cursor-pointer list-none gap-x-4 gap-y-1 px-4 py-4 transition hover:bg-slate-50 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-center sm:px-5">
              <div class="min-w-0">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
                  <span class="text-sm font-black text-slate-950">{{ member.name }}</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">{{ member.role }}</span>
                </div>
                {% if member.email %}
                <div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                  <a href="mailto:{{ member.email }}" class="text-xs font-bold text-[color:var(--usag-red)] underline decoration-[color:var(--usag-red)]/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-[color:var(--usag-red)]" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">{{ member.emailLabel }}</a>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1 self-center justify-self-end">
                <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--usag-red)] group-open:hidden">Duties &#x25BC;</span>
                <span class="hidden text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400 group-open:inline">Hide &#x25B2;</span>
              </div>
            </summary>
            <div class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-4 sm:px-5">
              <p class="max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">{{ member.duties }}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          {% endfor %}

        </div>

        {# Election notes #}
        <div class="mt-5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 shadow-sm">
          <div class="font-black text-slate-950">State Committee election notes</div>
          <p class="mt-1">Committee members are elected by the entire state professional membership for a two-year term concurrent with the State Chair. Each committee member has one vote; simple majority passes motions; State Chair votes only to break ties.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    {# Sidebar #}
    <aside class="space-y-6 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start">

      <section class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Meeting Minutes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Archive of committee meeting minutes and downloads.</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
          {% for minute in meeting_minutes.current %}
            <li>
              <a href="{{ minute.pdf_document or minute.document }}" class="inline-flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-800 underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-slate-900"><span aria-hidden="true">&#x2197;</span> <span>{{ minute.label }}{% if minute.pdf_document %} (PDF){% endif %}</span></a>
              {% if minute.pdf_document %}<a href="{{ minute.document }}" class="ml-2 text-xs font-bold text-[color:var(--usag-red)] underline decoration-[color:var(--usag-red)]/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-[color:var(--usag-red)]">Word</a>{% endif %}
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <details class="mt-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-[color:var(--usag-red)]">Older Minutes</summary>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
            {% for minute in meeting_minutes.older %}
              <li>
                <a href="{{ minute.pdf_document or minute.document }}" class="inline-flex items-start gap-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-800 underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-slate-900"><span aria-hidden="true">&#x2197;</span> <span>{{ minute.label }}{% if minute.pdf_document %} (PDF){% endif %}</span></a>
                {% if minute.pdf_document %}<a href="{{ minute.document }}" class="ml-2 text-xs font-bold text-[color:var(--usag-red)] underline decoration-[color:var(--usag-red)]/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-[color:var(--usag-red)]">Word</a>{% endif %}
              </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </details>
      </section>



    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
